## Requirements

- Node.js **>= 22.18.0** (for built-in TypeScript type stripping, so the
  `.ts` files run directly with no build step)
- npm or pnpm

## Quick start

```bash
npm install          # or: pnpm install
npm test             # node:test; no watcher, no network, no wallet required
npm run typecheck    # tsc --noEmit, strict
npm start            # prints the safety banner, attempts reads, prints an intent
```

`npm start` is safe to run with no configuration at all. With `RPC_URL` unset
it prints its banner, skips the network calls, and still prints an unsigned
intent for inspection.

## Project layout

```
